  "notes": "{改装|かいそう} typically refers to interior renovation.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {改装|かいそう}{中|ちゅう} (under renovation)\n- {改装|かいそう}オープン (reopening after renovation)\n- {全面|ぜんめん}{改装|かいそう} (complete renovation)\n- {店舗|てんぽ}{改装|かいそう} (store renovation)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {改築|かいちく}: rebuilding, reconstruction (structural)\n- {改造|かいぞう}: remodeling, modification\n- リフォーム: reform, renovation (loanword)",
